---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | RYTON LIMITED">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <header class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last Updated: April 28, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose mx-auto max-w-4xl text-slate-700">
      <p class="lead">
        RYTON LIMITED ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting the privacy of visitors to our website. This policy explains how we handle the personal data you provide to us through our static website and contact form.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        As a static business website, we limit data collection to what is strictly necessary for business communication and analytics.
      </p>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-4">Information You Provide (Contact Form)</h3>
      <p>
        When you submit an inquiry through our contact form (e.g., on the Contact Us or Products pages), we collect the following information:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
        <li>Your Name</li>
        <li>Company Name (if provided)</li>
        <li>Email Address</li>
        <li>Phone Number (if provided)</li>
        <li>Message Content (including any product SKUs or quote requests)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2">
        This data is transmitted directly to us and is not stored on this website itself. We use a third-party service (Netlify Forms) to process and securely deliver this data to our internal team.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information collected exclusively for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide you with requested quotes or information.</li>
        <li>To manage our customer and potential client relationships.</li>
        <li>For internal record-keeping and business analysis.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8">3. Data Retention and Security</h2>
      <p>
        We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected, including for the purposes of satisfying any legal, accounting, or reporting requirements. We take reasonable steps to protect the personal information we hold from misuse, loss, unauthorized access, modification, or disclosure.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8">4. Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
      <p>
        If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), you have certain rights under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), including:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
        <li>The right to access, update or delete the personal information we have on you.</li>
        <li>The right of rectification.</li>
        <li>The right to object.</li>
        <li>The right of restriction.</li>
        <li>The right to data portability.</li>
        <li>The right to withdraw consent.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2">
        To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@rytonlimited.com">info@rytonlimited.com</a>.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8">5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>